      "classification": "Independent shell contact active before and after cohesive deletion; no friction or damping credit; no edge-to-edge contact. Warning 94 is explicitly allowed only for disjoint main/secondary shell sets; it cautions about self-contact when gap exceeds half an element edge. Gap is not reduced to hide this warning."
